<title>USA: Inter-Regional names unit executive.</title>
<headline>Inter-Regional names unit executive.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Inter-Regional Financial Group Inc said it named Louis Fornetti, chief financial officer, to the additional post of chief executive officer of its Regional Operations Group Inc.</p>
<p>Inter-Regional is the parent of regional broker-dealers Dain Bosworth Inc in Minneapolis and Rauscher Pierce Refsnes Inc in Dallas.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
